{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/5476500b8d5614bc11e3b0fec3bc555a.avif?t=1750910404\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/a2a1b311ca9f0ef35af47918a1f459e2.poster.avif?t=1750910404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/a2a1b311ca9f0ef35af47918a1f459e2.webp?t=1750910404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to place or upgrade buildings and cast spells. Build your own custom deck and craft a unique defense strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/10b4e038b2ba658d4e566670a50b9be4.avif?t=1750910404\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/dcd783cdc27f43b75b8d2e961f2ad999.poster.avif?t=1750910404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/dcd783cdc27f43b75b8d2e961f2ad999.webp?t=1750910404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When night falls, the dark army swarms in. Your units and defense towers attack autonomously to protect the Goddess Statue. Choosing the right unit combos and upgrade effects is the key to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/d225a69f70360613372318aca03f802b.avif?t=1750910404\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/3d82f93b6f9bdcbccd1ae25fe79b43c1.poster.avif?t=1750910404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/3d82f93b6f9bdcbccd1ae25fe79b43c1.webp?t=1750910404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each goddess offers unique starting relics and deck, with more upgrades unlocked as she grows. After each successful defense, you'll earn new cards, relics, or encounter random events that send your fate in unexpected directions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/7c13c4cb535888a929d6d961b60445e1.avif?t=1750910404\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/581fb34d42bdee56155f25c96e1c6945.poster.avif?t=1750910404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/extras/581fb34d42bdee56155f25c96e1c6945.webp?t=1750910404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely combine cards, relics, and building upgrades to create a powerful line of defense. Protect the goddess and stand strong against the invading darkness!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183220?t=1750910404","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183220?t=1750910404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/52f2d7c7b1a8f7a17450ac574d436cc69aa2e1a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750910404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183220/